        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What is the typical MOQ for clothing manufacturers in Bangladesh?</h3>
        <p style="color:#ccc;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Most Bangladesh garment factories have MOQs ranging from 300 to 1,000 pieces per style. Premium manufacturers may require 1,000+ pieces, while smaller factories can sometimes accommodate 150-300 piece orders for startup brands.</p>
